                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Unfortunately I wasn't able to get this game to run properly. The game will outright crash if I try certain window sizes. When using any of the 'working' resolutions or full screen, the screen is flashing a lot and the game freezes in the intro cutscene. From what I've seen with other reviews, it may have something to do with my display's refresh rate (60Hz) but I don't think I'm able to lower that further? \nI'll update/delete this review if I become aware of a fix but right now I can't recommend paying $10+ for a indie game that can't run on modern systems.",
